  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "The Paula Scale measures QUASI's quantum computational capability on a 0-3 scale. Current focus: Q-Level 0 → 1 (compile + execute + verify on real QPU).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Model Performance",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/stats/d/quasi-model-performance/"
    },
    {
      "title": "Encefalos",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/stats/d/quasi-encefalos/"
    },
    {
      "title": "Paula Scale (Substack)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://thepaulascale.substack.com",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Paula Scale — Q-Level Overview",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What is the Paula Scale?",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### The Paula Scale\n\nA framework for measuring quantum computational capability, analogous to the Kardashev Scale for energy.\n\n| Q-Level | Capability | Milestone |\n|---|---|---|\n| **0** | Classical only | No quantum computation |\n| **1** | Molecular simulation | Compile + execute + verify on QPU |\n| **2** | Planetary simulation | Error-corrected logical qubits |\n| **3** | Universal simulation | Arbitrary quantum systems |\n\nHumanity is at **Q-Level 0.25–0.33** (2026).\n\n### QUASI's Journey: Q-Level 0 → 1\n\nThe MVP path maps to four capability bands:\n\n| Band | Phases | Q contribution |\n|---|---|---|\n| **L1** Language | 1–3 | 0.00 – 0.20 |\n| **L2** Compiler | 4–7 | 0.20 – 0.60 |\n| **L3** Hardware | 8–10 | 0.60 – 0.85 |\n| **L4** Runtime | 11–15 | 0.85 – 1.00 |\n\nQ-Level = Σ (level_avg% × band_width)"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Current Q-Level",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-BlYlRd" },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 4,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "blue", "value": 1.0 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": true,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT q_level FROM paula_scale ORDER BY snapshot_at DESC LIMIT 1;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Capability Levels",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 80 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L1 Language" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#73BF69", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L2 Compiler" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#FADE2A", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L3 Hardware" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#FF9830", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L4 Runtime" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#F2495C", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT l1_pct AS \"L1 Language\", l2_pct AS \"L2 Compiler\", l3_pct AS \"L3 Hardware\", l4_pct AS \"L4 Runtime\" FROM paula_scale ORDER BY snapshot_at DESC LIMIT 1;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Roadmap — Phase Completion",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Phase Completion (Paul's Boutique Tracklist)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#F2495C", "value": null },
              { "color": "#FF9830", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "#FADE2A", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "#73BF69", "value": 80 },
              { "color": "#56A64B", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "always",
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "stacking": "none",
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT phase || '. ' || phase_name AS phase, pct AS \"Completion\" FROM roadmap_progress WHERE snapshot_at = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_at) FROM roadmap_progress) ORDER BY phase;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "id": 300,
      "title": "Q-Level History",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Q-Level Over Time",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "pointSize": 6,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 4,
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT snapshot_at AS time, q_level AS \"Q-Level\" FROM paula_scale ORDER BY snapshot_at;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Capability Levels Over Time",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L1" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#73BF69", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L2" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#FADE2A", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L3" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#FF9830", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "L4" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#F2495C", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT snapshot_at AS time, l1_pct AS \"L1\", l2_pct AS \"L2\", l3_pct AS \"L3\", l4_pct AS \"L4\" FROM paula_scale ORDER BY snapshot_at;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "id": 400,
      "title": "Codebase — Lines of Code",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 401,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Source LOC by Component",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"] },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT component, SUM(loc_source) AS \"Source LOC\" FROM project_stats WHERE snapshot_at = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_at) FROM project_stats) AND loc_source > 0 GROUP BY component ORDER BY \"Source LOC\" DESC;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 402,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Source vs Test LOC",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Source" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#73BF69", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Tests" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#56A64B", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "always",
        "barWidth": 0.7,
        "stacking": "none",
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT component, SUM(loc_source) AS \"Source\", SUM(loc_tests) AS \"Tests\" FROM project_stats WHERE snapshot_at = (SELECT MAX(snapshot_at) FROM project_stats) AND (loc_source > 0 OR loc_tests > 0) GROUP BY component ORDER BY \"Source\" DESC;",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "id": 500,
      "title": "Senate Pipeline — Throughput",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 501,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pipeline Stats (All Time)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "ffeagtzfyvvnkf" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
